Rain Check: third-party assets and licences

Everything in the film is generated by code in this folder: the drawings (Canvas 2D), the CRT/videotape pass (WebGL),
the score and sound design (numpy synthesis, no samples), the subtitles. No stock footage, no generated images, no voices.

Library used to render and mix (clone, not a film asset): Lemo-Opuscar tools (cel.js, fx.js, post.js copied into this folder).
  https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar   see LICENSE there.

